{"seq":2,"slug":"request-waterfall-optimization","title":"请求瀑布流优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/architecture/request-waterfall-optimization","wordCount":1107,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"请求瀑布流优化\">请求瀑布流优化</h1><p>请求瀑布流（Request Waterfall）是前端性能中最隐蔽且破坏力最大的问题之一。当请求 B 依赖请求 A 的结果、请求 C 又依赖请求 B 的结果时，总加载时间是所有请求延迟的总和而非最大值。一个三层瀑布流在 200ms RTT 的网络条件下就意味着 600ms+ 的白屏时间——而这本可以通过并行化降至 200ms。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>瀑布流三大来源</strong>：组件层级（父渲染后子才请求）、数据依赖（B 的参数来自 A 的响应）、代码分割（chunk 加载后才发现需要数据）</li>\n<li><strong>请求提升（Hoisting）</strong>：将子组件的数据需求提升到路由 loader 或父级，消除渲染依赖带来的串行</li>\n<li><strong>useSuspenseQueries 防 Suspense 瀑布流</strong>：多个 suspense query 在同一组件中会因第一个 suspend 而阻塞后续——用批量 hook 解决</li>\n<li><strong>流式渲染 + 独立 Suspense</strong>：各区域独立获取独立显示，App Shell 立即渲染——从&quot;全部就绪才渲染&quot;变为&quot;渐进式呈现&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"识别瀑布流\">识别瀑布流</h2><p>瀑布流的根因是&quot;请求发起时机晚于必要时机&quot;。在 React 应用中，最常见的瀑布流源于组件层级的数据获取：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Browser as 浏览器&#10;    participant Layout as Layout 组件&#10;    participant Page as Page 组件&#10;    participant Widget as Widget 组件&#10;    participant Server as 服务端&#10;&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Layout: 渲染&#10;    Layout-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /api/user(认证信息)&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Layout: 用户数据&#10;    Layout-&gt;&gt;Page: 渲染子组件&#10;    Page-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /api/projects(依赖 user.orgId)&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Page: 项目列表&#10;    Page-&gt;&gt;Widget: 渲染子组件&#10;    Widget-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /api/projects/1/stats&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Widget: 统计数据&#10;    Note over Browser,Server: 总耗时 = RTT × 3(串行)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Browser as 浏览器\n    participant Layout as Layout 组件\n    participant Page as Page 组件\n    participant Widget as Widget 组件\n    participant Server as 服务端\n\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Layout: 渲染\n    Layout-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /api/user(认证信息)\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Layout: 用户数据\n    Layout-&gt;&gt;Page: 渲染子组件\n    Page-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /api/projects(依赖 user.orgId)\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Page: 项目列表\n    Page-&gt;&gt;Widget: 渲染子组件\n    Widget-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /api/projects/1/stats\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Widget: 统计数据\n    Note over Browser,Server: 总耗时 = RTT × 3(串行)</pre><p>在浏览器 DevTools 的 Network 面板中，瀑布流表现为请求的起始时间呈阶梯状递增。Chrome DevTools 的&quot;Initiator&quot;列可以追溯每个请求是由哪段代码触发的——这是定位瀑布流根因的关键线索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"瀑布流的三个来源\">瀑布流的三个来源</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组件层级</td>\n<td>父组件渲染后子组件才开始请求</td>\n<td>Layout → Page → Widget</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据依赖</td>\n<td>请求 B 的参数来自请求 A 的响应</td>\n<td>user.orgId → fetchProjects(orgId)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码分割</td>\n<td>异步 chunk 加载后才发现需要请求</td>\n<td><code>import()</code> → 组件加载 → 数据请求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"策略一-请求提升-hoisting\">策略一：请求提升（Hoisting）</h2><p>将子组件的数据请求提升到父级或路由级别，消除渲染依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 优化前：Widget 必须等 Page 渲染后才请求&#10;const Page = () =&gt; {&#10;  const { data: projects } = useQuery(projectQueries.list())&#10;  return projects?.map(p =&gt; &lt;ProjectWidget key={p.id} projectId={p.id} /&gt;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;const ProjectWidget = ({ projectId }: { projectId: string }) =&gt; {&#10;  // 瀑布流：必须等 Page 渲染后才知道 projectId&#10;  const { data: stats } = useQuery(projectQueries.stats(projectId))&#10;  return &lt;StatsChart data={stats} /&gt;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 优化后：在路由 loader 中并行预取所有已知数据&#10;const projectPageLoader = async () =&gt; {&#10;  const projects = await queryClient.ensureQueryData(projectQueries.list())&#10;  // 并行预取所有项目的统计数据&#10;  await Promise.all(&#10;    projects.map(p =&gt; queryClient.prefetchQuery(projectQueries.stats(p.id)))&#10;  )&#10;  return null&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 优化前：Widget 必须等 Page 渲染后才请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Page</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">projects</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(projectQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> projects?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ProjectWidget</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">projectId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} />)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProjectWidget</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">projectId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">projectId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 瀑布流：必须等 Page 渲染后才知道 projectId</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(projectQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(projectId))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StatsChart</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">// 优化后：在路由 loader 中并行预取所有已知数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">const projectPageLoader = async () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> projects</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queryClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ensureQueryData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(projectQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 并行预取所有项目的统计数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    projects.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queryClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prefetchQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(projectQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p.id)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>请求提升的核心原则：<strong>尽可能早地知道需要什么数据</strong>。如果路由 URL 中已经包含了足够的信息（如 <code>/projects/123/stats</code>），那么 stats 请求完全可以在路由解析阶段就并行发起，而无需等待组件树渲染。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略二-并行化\">策略二：并行化</h2><p>当多个请求没有真正的数据依赖时，应该并行执行而非串行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 反模式：顺序 await&#10;const user = await fetchUser(userId); // 200ms&#10;const settings = await fetchSettings(); // 150ms&#10;const notifications = await fetchNotifications(); // 100ms&#10;// 总计：450ms&#10;&#10;// 正确：Promise.all 并行&#10;const [user, settings, notifications] = await Promise.all([&#10;  fetchUser(userId), // 200ms&#10;  fetchSettings(), // 150ms（与上面并行）&#10;  fetchNotifications(), // 100ms（与上面并行）&#10;]);&#10;// 总计：200ms（取最大值）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 反模式：顺序 await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 200ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> settings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchSettings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 150ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> notifications</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchNotifications</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 100ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 总计：450ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确：Promise.all 并行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">settings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">notifications</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 200ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  fetchSettings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 150ms（与上面并行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  fetchNotifications</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 100ms（与上面并行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 总计：200ms（取最大值）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 React 组件中，多个 <code>useQuery</code> hook 天然并行（它们在同一渲染周期内注册）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 这三个查询自动并行执行——无需额外处理&#10;const { data: user } = useQuery(userQueries.detail(userId));&#10;const { data: settings } = useQuery(settingsQueries.current());&#10;const { data: notifications } = useQuery(notificationQueries.unread());\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 这三个查询自动并行执行——无需额外处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">detail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">settings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(settingsQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">notifications</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(notificationQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unread</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span></code></pre></div><p>但注意：如果使用 Suspense 模式，每个 <code>useSuspenseQuery</code> 会在数据返回前暂停渲染——多个 suspense query 在同一组件中会产生瀑布流（第一个 suspend 后，后续的 hook 不会执行）。解决方案是 <code>useSuspenseQueries</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 避免 Suspense 瀑布流&#10;const [{ data: user }, { data: posts }] = useSuspenseQueries({&#10;  queries: [userQueries.detail(userId), postQueries.byUser(userId)],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 避免 Suspense 瀑布流</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useSuspenseQueries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queries: [userQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">detail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId), postQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">byUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId)],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"策略三-流式渲染与渐进加载\">策略三：流式渲染与渐进加载</h2><p>React 18+ 的流式 SSR 和 Suspense 允许&quot;边获取边渲染&quot;——不必等待所有数据就绪才开始渲染：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// App Shell 立即渲染，各区域独立加载&#10;const DashboardPage = () =&gt; (&#10;  &lt;div className=&quot;grid grid-cols-3 gap-4&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;StatsSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;      &lt;StatsPanel /&gt;  {/* 独立获取 + 独立显示 */}&#10;    &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;ChartSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;      &lt;RevenueChart /&gt;  {/* 与 StatsPanel 并行 */}&#10;    &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;TableSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;      &lt;RecentOrders /&gt;  {/* 与上面两个并行 */}&#10;    &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// App Shell 立即渲染，各区域独立加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DashboardPage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div className</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{&#x3C;StatsSkeleton />}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">StatsPanel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 独立获取 + 独立显示 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{&#x3C;ChartSkeleton />}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RevenueChart </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 与 StatsPanel 并行 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{&#x3C;TableSkeleton />}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RecentOrders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 与上面两个并行 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"gantt\" data-source=\"gantt&#10;    title 传统 vs 流式加载&#10;    dateFormat X&#10;    axisFormat %s&#10;&#10;    section 传统(串行)&#10;    获取全部数据       :a1, 0, 600&#10;    渲染完整页面       :a2, 600, 100&#10;&#10;    section 流式(并行)&#10;    Shell 渲染         :b1, 0, 50&#10;    Stats 获取+渲染    :b2, 0, 200&#10;    Chart 获取+渲染    :b3, 0, 350&#10;    Orders 获取+渲染   :b4, 0, 400\">gantt\n    title 传统 vs 流式加载\n    dateFormat X\n    axisFormat %s\n\n    section 传统(串行)\n    获取全部数据       :a1, 0, 600\n    渲染完整页面       :a2, 600, 100\n\n    section 流式(并行)\n    Shell 渲染         :b1, 0, 50\n    Stats 获取+渲染    :b2, 0, 200\n    Chart 获取+渲染    :b3, 0, 350\n    Orders 获取+渲染   :b4, 0, 400</pre><h2 id=\"真正的数据依赖如何处理\">真正的数据依赖如何处理</h2><p>并非所有瀑布流都可以消除——当请求 B 确实需要请求 A 的返回值作为参数时，这是真正的数据依赖。对于这种情况：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>权衡</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>后端聚合</td>\n<td>BFF 层合并为一个接口</td>\n<td>增加后端复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GraphQL</td>\n<td>一次查询获取嵌套数据</td>\n<td>需要 GraphQL 基础设施</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冗余数据</td>\n<td>在 A 的响应中附带 B 所需数据</td>\n<td>API 设计耦合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推测预取</td>\n<td>基于已知 pattern 提前预取</td>\n<td>可能浪费请求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 后端聚合示例：合并两个依赖请求为一个&#10;// 原始：GET /user → GET /projects?orgId=xxx（瀑布流）&#10;// 聚合：GET /user-with-projects（单次请求）&#10;const { data } = useQuery({&#10;  queryKey: [&#39;user-dashboard&#39;, userId],&#10;  queryFn: () =&gt; fetch(`/api/user-dashboard/${userId}`).then((r) =&gt; r.json()),&#10;  select: (data) =&gt; ({&#10;    user: data.user,&#10;    projects: data.projects,&#10;  }),&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 后端聚合示例：合并两个依赖请求为一个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 原始：GET /user → GET /projects?orgId=xxx（瀑布流）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 聚合：GET /user-with-projects（单次请求）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user-dashboard'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, userId],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`/api/user-dashboard/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user: data.user,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    projects: data.projects,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"测量与监控\">测量与监控</h2><p>Chrome DevTools 的 Performance 面板可以精确测量瀑布流的影响。编程式测量可以通过 <code>PerformanceObserver</code> 实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 标记请求时间线用于分析&#10;const measureWaterfall = (label: string) =&gt; {&#10;  performance.mark(`${label}-start`);&#10;  return {&#10;    end: () =&gt; {&#10;      performance.mark(`${label}-end`);&#10;      performance.measure(label, `${label}-start`, `${label}-end`);&#10;    },&#10;  };&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 在查询中使用&#10;const queryFn = async () =&gt; {&#10;  const measure = measureWaterfall(&#39;user-fetch&#39;);&#10;  const result = await fetch(&#39;/api/user&#39;).then((r) =&gt; r.json());&#10;  measure.end();&#10;  return result;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 标记请求时间线用于分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> measureWaterfall</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">label</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}-start`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">label</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}-end`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">measure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(label, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">label</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}-start`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">label</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}-end`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在查询中使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> measure</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> measureWaterfall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user-fetch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  measure.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Web Vitals 中的 LCP（Largest Contentful Paint）和 INP（Interaction to Next Paint）是瀑布流优化的关键指标——瀑布流直接拖慢 LCP，而瀑布流导致的长任务会恶化 INP。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>瀑布流优化的核心策略三板斧：提升（尽早知道需要什么）、并行化（无依赖的请求同时发出）、流式渲染（不等全部就绪就开始呈现）。对于真正的数据依赖，通过后端聚合或 GraphQL 减少网络往返次数。瀑布流优化处理的是&quot;数据如何到达客户端&quot;的问题。最终，这些数据在客户端如何组织——哪些属于服务端状态、哪些属于客户端状态——决定了数据层的长期可维护性。这正是<a href=\"server-state-vs-client-state\">服务端状态与客户端状态分离</a>要讨论的架构原则。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"请求瀑布流优化","id":"请求瀑布流优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"识别瀑布流","id":"识别瀑布流"},{"level":2,"text":"瀑布流的三个来源","id":"瀑布流的三个来源"},{"level":2,"text":"策略一：请求提升（Hoisting）","id":"策略一-请求提升-hoisting"},{"level":2,"text":"策略二：并行化","id":"策略二-并行化"},{"level":2,"text":"策略三：流式渲染与渐进加载","id":"策略三-流式渲染与渐进加载"},{"level":2,"text":"真正的数据依赖如何处理","id":"真正的数据依赖如何处理"},{"level":2,"text":"测量与监控","id":"测量与监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预取与预加载策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/architecture/prefetching-preloading"},"next":{"title":"服务端状态与客户端状态分离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/architecture/server-state-vs-client-state"}}